          <span class="fc-indicator state-NOT_OBSERVED">IMF PortWatch 7-day avg crosses 20/day for two consecutive weeks</span>
          <span class="fc-indicator state-NOT_OBSERVED">Iran-MCM coordination mechanism re-activated under any new framework</span>
