      <p class="scenario-line"><strong class="label-prot">Protracted path:</strong> The strike-pause cycle continues at 1-3 day intervals without a comprehensive deal; Hormuz commercial traffic stays below 25 vessels/day (F11 unresolved) through September; F13 resolves NO.</p>
      <p class="scenario-line"><strong class="label-desc">De-escalation path:</strong> F13 resolves YES — a new formal ceasefire holds past 72 hours, creating conditions for renewed structured negotiations, partial Hormuz commercial recovery, and a pathway toward F8 before August 16.</p>
