      <p>Iranian state media (IRNA, PressTV, Tasnim) carried no new footage or authenticated audio of Mojtaba Khamenei between July 19 and July 25. Coverage was limited to written statements issued under the Office of the Supreme Leader letterhead and archived video from Ali Khamenei's funeral proceedings. IRGC official communiqués used the Supreme Leader formulation throughout, without naming Mojtaba in an active command context. The 40-day memorial for Ali Khamenei falls on approximately August 17-18. → <span class="context-only">context only</span></p>
      <p>PressTV's July 24 broadcast featured a retrospective on Ali Khamenei's 1989-2026 tenure with no reference to current Supreme Leader statements. IRIB ran a ninety-second item on "the leadership's position on the Hormuz situation," attributed to an anonymous senior official rather than to Mojtaba Khamenei by name. The pattern of anonymous official attribution rather than named-Supreme-Leader coverage has been unbroken across all six monitored state media outlets since the March 8 succession announcement. → supports <span class="cite">F10</span> without move</p>
    </div>
